## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates the ability to craft a robust, end-to-end evaluation pipeline for multilingual policy-faithfulness in a high-stakes financial setting, with versioned source control and drift monitoring.

## Key Concepts

- Multilingual claim extraction and anchor mapping
- Versioned source citations and live policy integration
- Drift detection and change management across monthly updates

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal citation check
function checkCitation(claim, citation, policyDB) {
  const live = policyDB.lookup(citation.version, citation.id);
  return live && live.text.includes(claim.anchor);
}
```

